  "html": "<p>Wolf Pups are small Wolves.\n</p><p><b>Race:</b> <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Wolves\" title=\"Category:Wolves\">Wolf</a>\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Melee \n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2><span class=\"editsection\">[<a href=\"/wiki/Wolf_Pup\" title=\"Edit section: Basic Types\">edit</a>]</span> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<ul><li> Dew Valley Wolf Pup. You will first encounter these in <a href=\"/wiki/Dew_Valley\" title=\"Dew Valley\">Dew Valley</a> Forest.\n</li><li> Warg Pup. You find these on the upper levels of <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>.\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Uniques\"></a><h2><span class=\"editsection\">[<a href=\"/wiki/Wolf_Pup\" title=\"Edit section: Uniques\">edit</a>]</span> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Uniques</span></h2>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
